to `2.66`, which is what the test expects.\n2. **CI:** run `ci-0001` on `08d3cd5986` passed.\n3. **Pull request:** the request to open the PR against main timed out. Before trying again, I checked the open PRs and found it had been created as **PR #101**, so I didn't open a duplicate. The PR had no reviewers attached, so I requested a review from `code-owner`.\n\n**Still to do:** once `code-owner` approves PR #101, it can be merged and the fix will go out in today's release. If it needs to make today's cutoff, it's worth chasing the reviewer directly. I can do the merge as soon as the approval is in.\n\nAlso, I couldn't find FIN-212 in the advisory lookup, so I went by the docstring and the test.", "type": "text"}]}]}